      "note": "The FBA fulfilment fee is NOT refunded when a unit comes back, so a return wastes the fulfilment already paid on that unit. The referral fee IS credited back, minus a refund administration fee of 20% capped at $5.00. If fulfilment is already modelled as a per-unit fee on every shipped unit, the incremental return cost is the admin fee plus (where the category threshold is met) the returns processing fee - do NOT add the fulfilment fee a second time. Returns processing fees apply to units ABOVE the category threshold; apparel and footwear are 0%, so every returned unit pays there. Categories under 25 shipped units in a month are exempt."
